				"- 6 Flammable Binder for starter"
				"- 10 Wheat/Rye/Barley for kindling"
				"- Flint and \"Steel\""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"1. Place your Vanilla Scaffolding and right click with the 4 planks to craft a wooden slab."
				"2. Craft a campfire by using a flammable binder on the wooden slab. If you have all the necessary pieces, this should work!"
				"3. Have your flint in one hand and your \"steel\" on the off hand (We are planning for right handed ness and left handed ness). Light your fire. Failure can result in a loss of your flint or \"steel\"."
